 vertebrae i knocked my left  shoulder out of place and tore my  rhomboid on my right side it took me out  of filming for a month  number four now watch me whip  now watch me regret it in the first thor  movie chris hemsworth borrowed loki's  whip and regretted it almost immediately  upon hitting himself in the face don't  touch other people's props what can we  say  number five tom was seeing asgard after  this one in the first movie a fight  scene between chris and tom resulted in  tom's seeing stars you could literally  freeze frame the moment something went  awry  during the fourth take in a moment where  loki is supposed to spear thor but thor  dodges it grabs the spear and hits loki  in the face tom got a little bit too  close i felt the full force of the  hemsworth elbow  in my face number six like father like  son inspired by his dad's heroics on the  set of the avengers one of chris  hemsworth's twin boys left out of a golf  cart and broke his leg hemsworth recalls  he's kind of half crying sulking more  embarrassed that he didn't stick the  landing but chris also recalled he gets  the cast off a day or two later i'm  cooking dinner and he's standing on the  bench top and he's like papa look my  leg's better he leaps off the bench a  perfect landing that's one proud dad and  if you weren't already aware chris's  whole family has made an appearance in  love and thunder his wife was in a  previous thor film as the stand-in for  natalie portman and she came back to  play a wolf woman and their twins  tristan played a young thor and sasha  one of the asgardian kids and of course  we can't forget that chris's daughter  india played gore's daughter but she had  to audition for that role number seven  the taxing mind games that nails can  play is not to be questioned in love and  thunder the god butcher was going insane  wearing fake nails christian bale  couldn't eat and at times he just felt  like he was immobile too the nails were  definitely playing tricks on 