ped away and the doubles  just have to take that hard hit bobby  admitted it's just part and parcel of  what we do and we know those risks well  he hurt himself pretty freaking bad in  thor ragnarok he snapped his groin off  the bone by doing a jumping kick flip to  try and kick the hulk in the gladiator  scene they did a rehearsal and the hulk  is so much taller and so bobby had a  wire assist to manage the kick between  the wires and bobby going all out he  hyper-extended and snapped a bit of his  adductor longus the inner thigh and  rectus abdominus i.e the abs right off  the bone so yeah that took a while to  heal number 11. this poor guy just can't  catch a break  such as life for stunt doubles bobby  holland hampton chris's stunt double was  really struggling with putting on the  pounds of muscle for thor love and  thunder chris was bigger than ever and  it's been really taxing on bobby to not  only eat every two freaking hours but  also he said i find carrying around the  extra weight is difficult and hard to  maintain on the ligaments but he's all  good look at him he's a man mountain  number 12. tom must be a good actor if  he can calm an anxious artist with just  a look brianna darnell who was the  stand-in for sophia's sylvian loki was  suffering from a brain injury she'd  received previously and found herself  having a flare-up on set this flare-up  kept her from remembering even basic  choreography it got bad enough that tom  had to tell her what to do and where to  go as her anxiety was going through the  roof and she was near a panic attack tom  took her by the shoulders and just  looked in her eyes with such a gentle  gaze at the time she didn't realize this  was part of the scene  and definitely just thought he was being  kind and trying to calm her panic attack  which hey hiddleston's an intune actor  he would have been responding to her  organically and most definitely picked  up on the anxiety and tried to solve the  problem  either way it was pr